    "Candidate visits need the licensed face SDK and cross-camera re-identification, which are not installed. Linked incidents below were associated by people, not by matching.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Candidate visits need the licensed face SDK and cross-camera re-identification, which are not installed. Linked incidents below were associated by people, not by matching."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来店候補の表示には、ライセンス版の顔認識SDKとカメラ間の再識別機能が必要ですが、導入されていません。以下の関連事案は、照合ではなく担当者が関連付けたものです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Candidates are ordered by the face SDK's similarity ranking. Rank is not a probability or an identification; review the evidence before acting.": {
